      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> The task requires creating multiple Python files for text-to-speech service integrations using Google's Text-to-Speech API. The files are categorized into same-scenario scored files, local helper files, and later-step scored files. Each scored file must use a concrete external provider, which in this case is Google. The local helper files will provide configuration and utility functions. The later-step scored files will handle additional tasks like translation, safety checks, embedding, and transcription. I need to create these files with the necessary imports and provider-specific code to meet the requirements. </thinking>\n",
